      <name>1. Cold Spring-Saguache Creek</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>B1-01 N-timber 9517</name>
        <description>North-facing valley at 9,517 ft, 45% canopy, 26% slope; 1.1 mi from the nearest motorized route, 0.25 mi to water. Imagery: inside a band of live conifer, moderate density, openings on both sides (satellite 2025-07-03). (score 0.95)</description>
